{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/606d771bc91a3ece33bbd4e5549d9428.avif?t=1768070240\" width=956 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Octane100</strong> is a pixel turn-based action game with roguelike elements, where victory depends not only on raw power, but on how you combine items. Every run is an experiment, and a single successful build can completely turn the tide of the war against the oil corporation Octane100.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/91cd1c1c6e1561797bb5ada21a2b227e.poster.avif?t=1768070240\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/91cd1c1c6e1561797bb5ada21a2b227e.webm?t=1768070240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/91cd1c1c6e1561797bb5ada21a2b227e.mp4?t=1768070240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/79fac0354137140a6f8524d2bccacb0d.poster.avif?t=1768070240\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/79fac0354137140a6f8524d2bccacb0d.webm?t=1768070240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/79fac0354137140a6f8524d2bccacb0d.mp4?t=1768070240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/5e6be152de6ed77205845b867fdeb3b8.poster.avif?t=1768070240\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/5e6be152de6ed77205845b867fdeb3b8.webm?t=1768070240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/5e6be152de6ed77205845b867fdeb3b8.mp4?t=1768070240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 heroes</strong> with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ items</strong> that create unexpected synergies, break the rules of combat, and give you a chance to snatch victory even in seemingly hopeless situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike progression</strong>. Every run is different, your decisions matter, and defeat is part of learning and discovering stronger combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 difficulty levels</strong>: Easy for experimentation, Hardcore for tactical play, and Rogue for those seeking a real challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shop with an unpredictable inventory</strong>, where the right purchase can become the key to a perfect build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map mode</strong>, where you can explore the game world and build your own automation chains for fuel supply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible hats and trails</strong>, so every victory looks stylish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges and badges</strong> for those who want to test the limits of their tactics.</p></li></ul>",